  ('calgary', 'CONDITIONAL', 'Jobs via The City of Calgary (https://www.calgary.ca/careers.html), open data "City of Calgary Careers" (https://data.calgary.ca/d/City-of-Calgary-Careers/5fsi-n9xm). Contains information licensed under the Open Government Licence – City of Calgary (https://data.calgary.ca/stories/s/Open-Calgary-Terms-of-Use/u45n-7awa/)', false),
  ('sinees', 'CONDITIONAL', 'Jobs via SINE-ES, the Agências do Trabalhador of the state of Espírito Santo, Brazil (Secretaria de Estado de Trabalho, Assistência e Desenvolvimento Social, SETADES; https://setades.es.gov.br/vagas-de-empregos), open data "Vagas das agências estaduais do trabalhador" (https://dados.es.gov.br/dataset/c43d6653-634a-4e6e-bd66-c9ca3f6ee106), Creative Commons Attribution (http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-by). The SINE does not name the employer; apply at the Agência do Trabalhador named in the listing', false),
  ('usajobs', 'CONDITIONAL', 'Jobs via USAJOBS, the job site of the United States federal government, operated by the U.S. Office of Personnel Management (https://www.usajobs.gov), Public Data under the USAJOBS API Terms of Service (https://developer.usajobs.gov/guides/terms-of-service). OrbiJob is not operated or endorsed by the U.S. Office of Personnel Management; every listing links to the current official announcement on usajobs.gov', false)
